text = "You're fine, but that's because you don't take fall damage in any scenario.
That was (probably) a big impact that Hoggard made; maybe you should go look for him?
If you're wondering about the audience, they're fine. 
Anthro Wrestling Union has been much more careful with how they treat the audience since that episode in 2003."

